# Generated by the harness — always reproducible from scenario.yaml/data.yaml/tests.yaml.
scenarios/*/generated/

# Raw promptfoo output per run — large (repeats the full prompt per row), and
# reproducible by re-running. *.judged.json (the harness's own structured verdicts) and
# SUMMARY.md/CONTRACT.md (the human-readable report) next to it ARE committed.
runs/*/*.results.json

# Heavy or reproducible per-run artifacts: manifest.json, snapshots/ (text, small), and
# judged.json/EXTRACT.md/*.md ARE committed (the provenance record + human report). The
# processed images, generated viewer pages, and a dirty-worktree patch are not — they're
# either large, or derivable from the committed JSON, or a rare-case debugging aid.
runs/*/inputs/
runs/*/*.html
runs/index.html
runs/*/worktree.diff

harness/harness
harness/xchats-evals-harness
